# Files excluded when someone runs
#   quarto use template Pat-Laub/UNSW-Quarto-Slides-Template
# so they get a clean starting point: template.qmd, custom.scss, unsw-logo.png
# and scripts/print_slides_pdfs.py.
#
# The drawing tools and the slide stage are not listed: Quarto skips
# `_extensions` when copying a template's files and installs the extensions
# properly instead, so a new deck gets them without this repo's git plumbing.
#
# These are rendered copies of the template, committed only so that
# GitHub Pages can serve them.
template.html
template.pdf
template_files/**
index.qmd
index.html
index_files/**
*.zip
